5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We need a system based on facts, not feelings. I want to know the actual time commitment for these rooms.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree! It feels unfair lately. I want to see who is actually using the space and who is doing the work.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,My main concern is that we stay on good terms. We need a method that stops the passive-aggressive tension.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know about the money! Who is paying for the soap and bags? We need a clear monthly cost.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I just... I want the rooms to be consistently clean. I hate not knowing what I'll find when I walk in.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, that suggests we need to define ""done."" I'll look into the timing and the standards.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'll check the calendar and the kitchen use. We can't have people who are never here dodging work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I'll look at the house chat history and the note from the previous tenants to see what failed before.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm going to check the receipts and the management office rates. We need to see if paying someone is viable.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll look at the bathroom grout and what everyone counts as ""done."" I want to understand why it gets dirty.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
