35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"A full pass takes about 102 minutes. Also, we all have different definitions of ""done,"" which explains the inconsistency.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It's worse than I thought. Some of us are barely here, yet the kitchen mess comes from only a few people.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The house chat shows our fights start with reminders. Previous tenants tried permanent rooms, but they stopped speaking to each other.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"We're wasting money buying duplicates of spray, and the management office charges 4,200 yen an hour for cleaners.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The bathroom grout gets black again in eleven days because of poor ventilation. No wonder it feels grim so quickly.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, if a professional takes two hours, that's 8,400 yen. Is that cheaper than our time and stress?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, the workload isn't even. If we use a rota, the people who aren't here still get a turn, which is unfair.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, but permanent assignments lead to resentment, as the previous tenants found. We must avoid that.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"We already spend 2,300 yen a month on supplies alone. A professional service would be a predictable monthly bill.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"If we have a professional, the standard would be the same every time. I wouldn't have to worry.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The time investment is significant. Nearly two hours of deep cleaning is a lot to ask of everyone weekly.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,But paying for a service means the people who barely use the kitchen are subsidizing the heavy users.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I'd rather pay a bit more than have us fighting in the group chat every single week.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,Exactly! A set invoice is easier than chasing people for 500 yen for bin bags.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with Victoria. I just want the stress to go away.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Logic suggests that if we value our time and peace, outsourcing is the most stable long-term solution.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I still worry about the fairness of the cost, but I suppose it's better than a broken rota.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Let's consider the options. A professional service seems the safest for our friendship.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,It's the most transparent way to handle the money too.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'm in favor of anything that guarantees the bathroom stays clean.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
