60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A is too risky for harmony. Option B is unfair regarding usage. Option C is the most efficient.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm torn, but Option B's unfairness is a dealbreaker. I'll go with C if we split it equally.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Option A is a disaster waiting to happen. Option C removes the ""reminder"" triggers that cause our rows.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option C is perfect. One bill, one payment, no more guessing who paid for the bleach.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option C is the only one that solves the consistency problem for me.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, is the cost acceptable to you if it means no more cleaning?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mio,,"Yes, I can manage the cost if it means the house stays peaceful.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Victoria,,I think we are all in agreement then.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,I'll handle the billing if we go with C!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"That would be great, Rin.","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'll vote for C. It's the most rational choice for our time.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'll vote for C as well.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,C for me. Harmony first.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,C! Definitely C.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,C.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
